<title>UK: LME copper ends AM kerb firmer, just under $2,300.</title>
<headline>LME copper ends AM kerb firmer, just under $2,300.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Wider spreads boost three months, which ends AM kerb stronger, but off highs and just under $2,300.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Off peak, but finishes with good gains just under $1,580.</p>
<p>ZINC - Slightly firmer, in tight range. LEAD - Stronger above $630.</p>
<p>TIN - Up with others. NICKEL - Unchanged, back below $7,400.</p>
</text>
